  (text "What this does: Measures low-g acceleration and rotation with a second IMU from TDK.\nConnects to: Flight MCU SPI/control/interrupt pins -> this sensor. Fed from FLIGHT_3V3 through R3201, a 47 ohm link, like the ST IMU (D-6.6, D-2Nov.3)."
